WEBVTT

00:01.465 --> 00:03.795
shinjitai
I want to believe

00:03.895 --> 00:06.955
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light that I found that day

00:07.435 --> 00:10.175
kimi to kawashita
Because I still have

00:10.175 --> 00:14.835
tatta hitotsuno yakusoku ga arukara
That one promise that I made to you

00:15.245 --> 00:22.245
mou tachidomarazuni aruite yukitai
I want to keep walking, never stopping

00:23.955 --> 00:26.825
Dragon Drive

00:26.825 --> 00:32.355
uresugita kajitsu wo kajiru youni
Like biting into an overripe fruit

00:32.465 --> 00:35.435
yowai jibun ni
I was spoiling myself

00:35.435 --> 00:38.695
amaetsuzukete ita
I was giving in to my weakness

00:39.165 --> 00:43.535
kimi ni deawanakereba
If I hadn't met you

00:43.535 --> 00:45.505
ima mo
I'd still...

00:45.505 --> 00:51.845
kabe wo kowasu koto nado dekinakatta yo
...be unable to break the walls around me

00:53.545 --> 00:55.915
wasurenai
I'll never forget

00:55.915 --> 00:59.145
ano hi kanjita itami
The pain that I felt that day

00:59.455 --> 01:04.465
nido to ano basho modoritakunai
I never want to go back to that place

01:04.465 --> 01:06.055
motto tsuyoku
This strong feeling

01:06.165 --> 01:08.565
shinjitai
I want to believe

01:08.565 --> 01:11.725
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light I found that day

01:12.105 --> 01:17.175
kakkowarui to warawaretemo ii
Let them laugh and call me a loser

01:17.175 --> 01:19.905
bukiyou dakara
Because I'm clumsy

01:19.905 --> 01:27.615
onaji ikikata shika erabenainda
I can only choose to live life this way

01:40.025 --> 01:44.465
Each country in Rikyu
sends its best Dragon Drive team...

01:45.235 --> 01:48.275
...to a tournament
to determine who is the strongest.

01:48.275 --> 01:50.175
That is the Dragonic Heaven!

01:50.705 --> 01:54.645
And only those who achieve victory
at Dragonic Heaven are allowed...

01:54.645 --> 01:56.875
...to lay their eyes upon the holy treasure.

01:56.875 --> 01:58.905
That is the Dragonite.

01:59.115 --> 02:01.155
Where's the old lady?!

02:01.155 --> 02:02.135
Right here.

02:05.355 --> 02:06.185
That's odd.

02:06.185 --> 02:07.585
You're too weak!

02:10.955 --> 02:13.985
I don't know what to believe in at all.

02:16.295 --> 02:18.455
Lightning Wave!

02:20.665 --> 02:22.105
You'd better win.

02:23.475 --> 02:24.465
Y-Yes.

02:25.875 --> 02:29.075
The Fight Begins

02:51.165 --> 02:52.465
Amazing!

02:52.735 --> 02:54.295
It sure is! I'm so excited!

02:55.375 --> 02:57.135
I feel so sick.

02:57.135 --> 02:58.205
You okay?

02:58.205 --> 02:59.505
What's up, Daisuke?

02:59.505 --> 03:00.635
You seem down.

03:01.005 --> 03:03.175
Look where we are!

03:03.175 --> 03:04.505
We're way up here!

03:06.145 --> 03:08.615
Hey! Yahoo!

03:08.885 --> 03:11.785
It's true what they say:
Idiots enjoy being up high.

03:12.325 --> 03:13.415
Just a little further.

03:14.425 --> 03:17.915
The Dragonic Heaven takes place
just over those mountains.

03:22.035 --> 03:23.035
This map...

03:23.035 --> 03:24.295
That's right.

03:24.295 --> 03:27.535
If you switch the land and the water,
it looks just like a map of Earth.

03:27.705 --> 03:28.495
Yes.

03:28.605 --> 03:30.935
It's like a totally reversed version of Earth.

03:31.175 --> 03:35.005
Because of how the land looks, RI-ON
named this world "Rikyu" or "Other Earth".

03:35.545 --> 03:37.475
I still can't believe it.

03:37.475 --> 03:39.745
What was just a game is actually reality.

03:40.285 --> 03:42.375
It's like some kind of bad dream.

03:42.485 --> 03:44.385
Now, don't say that.

03:44.625 --> 03:45.745
Owww!

03:46.025 --> 03:47.575
What do you think you're doing?!

03:48.525 --> 03:49.595
Did that wake you up?

03:49.595 --> 03:52.765
If you're going to be all dazed like that,
you're not going to survive in this world.

03:52.765 --> 03:54.055
Right, Gokaku?

03:54.465 --> 03:55.055
Yeah.

03:55.095 --> 03:58.805
A guy like you
will never be able to attract a girl!

03:58.805 --> 04:00.605
- I'll never forgive you!
- Hey, Meguru...

04:00.605 --> 04:02.975
- It still hurts!
...who else will compete?

04:02.975 --> 04:05.735
We need three members per team
or we can't fight in the tournament.

04:05.905 --> 04:07.975
Yes, I know.

04:07.975 --> 04:10.605
But right now,
I don't have a dragon to ride on, so...

04:11.045 --> 04:13.315
That's why I said that I'll take part!

04:13.645 --> 04:15.155
Where are you going to get a dragon?

04:15.155 --> 04:16.455
I'll manage.

04:16.455 --> 04:19.445
We're not so desperate
that we'd take just any dragon.

04:20.685 --> 04:21.675
I'll do it!

04:24.095 --> 04:25.495
I'll compete.

04:25.495 --> 04:27.185
Are you sure you're okay, Daisuke?

04:27.225 --> 04:28.835
Is this guy strong enough?

04:28.835 --> 04:29.925
Yeah, he is.

04:30.395 --> 04:31.695
Daisuke's pretty strong.

04:31.935 --> 04:32.925
Reiji!

04:33.265 --> 04:34.605
What are you talking about?

04:34.605 --> 04:36.665
How can someone who gets sick so easily...

04:39.975 --> 04:40.905
See?

04:40.905 --> 04:42.845
Even Kanper is saying he's strong.

04:42.845 --> 04:43.835
Right?

04:44.315 --> 04:46.505
I just hope he's not all bark and no bite.

04:46.715 --> 04:47.685
Finally.

04:47.685 --> 04:49.285
Finally, I get my chance.

04:49.285 --> 04:51.415
An opportunity to show off my cool side...

04:52.025 --> 04:55.285
...and capture my sweet honey's heart
with my iron grip.

04:55.595 --> 04:57.425
Squish, squish, squish...

04:57.425 --> 04:58.795
Sure, why not?

04:58.895 --> 05:01.655
You'll be the third guy.
I look forward to fighting with you.

05:04.295 --> 05:05.285
Yeah!

05:10.435 --> 05:12.975
H-Hey, where do you think you're going?!

05:12.975 --> 05:14.165
D-Daisuke!

05:15.145 --> 05:16.745
Oh, no!

05:16.745 --> 05:18.345
We're going to crash into that mountain!

05:18.345 --> 05:19.645
Ascend! Ascend!

05:20.145 --> 05:22.785
Hurry, hurry! We have to pull up!

05:22.785 --> 05:26.155
- It's not working!
- Come on! Hurry!

05:55.685 --> 05:57.545
That's the hotel where we'll be staying.

05:57.755 --> 06:00.025
There sure are a lot of people here.

06:00.025 --> 06:02.885
The Dragonic Heaven
must be quite the tournament.

06:03.755 --> 06:05.385
Hey, what's that?!

06:05.565 --> 06:07.225
Reiji! Where are you going?!

06:07.865 --> 06:10.265
Let him be. You can hang with me instead.

06:10.265 --> 06:12.135
But it looks like fun.

06:12.135 --> 06:14.435
- Wait for me!
- H-Hey! My sweet honey!

06:25.445 --> 06:27.915
Darn! I can't see at all!

06:30.555 --> 06:31.545
Ow!

06:33.325 --> 06:34.845
What're you trying to do?!

06:36.995 --> 06:38.785
What do you want?!

06:40.325 --> 06:41.295
What is it?

06:41.295 --> 06:43.495
You gotta problem with us?

06:43.495 --> 06:44.395
Well, kid?

06:45.135 --> 06:47.535
Uh, well, I've got no problem.

06:47.535 --> 06:49.175
I was just admiring your shapely bottom...

06:49.175 --> 06:50.835
Hey, brothers!

06:53.075 --> 06:54.905
I'll buy you some drinks...

06:55.145 --> 06:57.005
...so how about we just let it pass?

06:57.115 --> 06:58.085
What?!

06:58.085 --> 06:59.415
Y-You're!

07:00.245 --> 07:02.075
Rockaku the Lightning!

07:03.315 --> 07:05.855
The one who went crazy last time?

07:05.855 --> 07:07.185
And got kicked out?

07:09.555 --> 07:11.525
Now, come on. Never mind that.

07:11.525 --> 07:12.925
Let's all go and have a drink.

07:13.025 --> 07:14.025
Rockaku!

07:14.025 --> 07:15.535
What about the promise you made to Ensui?

07:15.535 --> 07:18.035
Ah, you want to go, too?

07:18.035 --> 07:19.665
Oh, well, I guess you can tag along.

07:21.875 --> 07:23.175
Now, let's go!

07:23.175 --> 07:25.035
- Can we just let this happen?
- Why not?

07:25.445 --> 07:28.275
Huh? Reiji, where's Chibi?

07:28.275 --> 07:29.345
What?

07:29.345 --> 07:30.675
Huh? What?

07:30.675 --> 07:32.715
No way! He's gone!

07:32.715 --> 07:35.375
Maybe he fell into the river earlier!

07:40.425 --> 07:41.825
Chibi.

07:41.825 --> 07:42.655
Darn!

07:43.855 --> 07:45.825
Your dragon's a weakling.

07:45.825 --> 07:46.795
Shut up!

07:46.795 --> 07:49.365
Yours doesn't have much experience, either!

07:49.365 --> 07:51.295
But mine has more experience than yours.

07:51.295 --> 07:53.165
Not by much!

07:54.035 --> 07:55.735
What is going on?

07:55.735 --> 07:58.395
Reiji Ozora and the others have vanished.

07:58.475 --> 08:00.775
Why is it life as usual right here?

08:00.775 --> 08:01.615
And yet...

08:01.615 --> 08:02.665
...after that...

08:08.185 --> 08:10.485
...the Special Training Room...

08:13.925 --> 08:16.655
...has ceased to exist.

08:18.365 --> 08:22.455
They're trying to make it as if that day
didn't even happen.

08:44.885 --> 08:46.755
What is that room?

08:51.025 --> 08:53.665
I don't think you should pursue it right now.

08:53.665 --> 08:54.465
Why is that?

08:54.465 --> 08:58.265
Even if you were to get in,
it's not just Miss L that's there.

08:58.335 --> 08:59.965
How do you know all this?

08:59.965 --> 09:02.875
Ever since Reiji Ozora disappeared...

09:02.875 --> 09:07.175
...it feels as if there's a hole in my heart,
and emptiness in my soul.

09:07.175 --> 09:09.165
That's not what I'm asking you about.

09:09.675 --> 09:11.245
What exactly is beyond there?

09:11.245 --> 09:14.045
And where did Reiji and Daisuke,
and Maiko disappear to?

09:15.755 --> 09:19.815
Apparently there's a wonderful world
that the dragons will take you to.

09:21.355 --> 09:24.825
A different world called "Rikyu".
It means "Other Earth".

09:24.825 --> 09:25.795
"Rikyu"?

09:25.795 --> 09:29.925
I heard that there's a power there
that can grant any wish.

09:30.095 --> 09:31.825
You want me to believe that?

09:31.935 --> 09:34.335
I'm not asking you to believe anything.

09:34.635 --> 09:38.805
You asked where Reiji and the others
disappeared to, so I'm just answering.

09:39.175 --> 09:41.805
And they're not the only ones
who have disappeared.

09:42.745 --> 09:43.145
There's more?

09:43.145 --> 09:44.805
Yes, about three.

09:45.215 --> 09:46.685
Oh, now that you mention it...

09:46.985 --> 09:48.755
You know who I mean?

09:48.755 --> 09:49.405
Yes, but...

09:49.515 --> 09:52.185
But it's the truth, as unlikely as it seems.

09:57.195 --> 09:58.465
Darn!

09:58.465 --> 10:00.365
Just how far did Chibi drift away?!

10:00.895 --> 10:02.095
Chibi!

10:10.675 --> 10:11.665
Reiji!

10:12.845 --> 10:14.445
What was that?

10:14.445 --> 10:16.565
He just stared at me.

10:17.475 --> 10:18.465
Reiji?

10:18.615 --> 10:20.175
Oh, uh...

10:20.885 --> 10:23.685
I felt something around them.

10:23.915 --> 10:26.215
But I don't think it's connected to Chibi.

10:26.355 --> 10:27.655
Did you find Chibi?

10:27.655 --> 10:29.295
Huh? Uh, no!

10:29.295 --> 10:31.055
I think he's been washed further downriver!

10:31.055 --> 10:32.565
- H-Hey!
- Wait a minute!

10:32.565 --> 10:34.295
Um, I'm still not feeling well.

10:34.295 --> 10:36.325
Then why don't you just rest there?

10:36.595 --> 10:38.695
Reiji! Hang on!

10:40.435 --> 10:41.635
No.

10:41.635 --> 10:43.835
You're so cold, Maiko Yukino...

10:45.275 --> 10:46.845
Reiji Ozora.

10:46.845 --> 10:48.105
Forget him, forget him.

10:48.105 --> 10:50.375
He's not our goal, after all.

10:50.675 --> 10:53.205
Besides, he doesn't seem very strong at all.

10:54.715 --> 10:56.185
Don't take him too lightly.

10:56.455 --> 10:58.215
Yeah, I guess.

10:59.555 --> 11:00.915
I wonder.

11:01.225 --> 11:05.525
Well, we'll know soon enough
whether he's the real thing.

11:27.485 --> 11:28.615
What a funny-looking one.

11:28.615 --> 11:30.105
But he's so very cute.

11:36.025 --> 11:37.425
Hey, what's your name?

11:38.765 --> 11:41.285
"Gee"? What a strange name!

11:41.565 --> 11:43.125
Well, it's certainly a strange dragon.

11:43.465 --> 11:44.895
Let's adopt him.

11:45.735 --> 11:48.465
Lin, can I hold him, too?

11:55.245 --> 11:58.175
Now, what should we do for fun?

12:05.455 --> 12:06.955
Did you find Chibi?

12:06.955 --> 12:07.925
No.

12:08.155 --> 12:09.855
I completely lost him.

12:09.855 --> 12:12.695
Don't worry.
I'm sure Chibi's somewhere.

12:12.695 --> 12:14.665
A small, white dragon?

12:15.665 --> 12:17.695
- Does it do tricks?
- I don't know...

12:17.695 --> 12:20.295
...but I hear there's something interesting
going on down at the port.

12:21.405 --> 12:23.035
A small, white dragon?

12:23.035 --> 12:25.005
Doing tricks at the port?

12:28.515 --> 12:29.495
Chibi!

12:32.615 --> 12:34.605
Where's the port?!

12:39.885 --> 12:42.055
It can't even do one act.

12:42.055 --> 12:44.085
What an untalented dragon.

12:44.795 --> 12:49.095
I'm starting to become bored,
big brother Lin.

12:49.095 --> 12:53.055
At this rate, we'll only be able to use him
as feed for Ekkinsigan.

12:53.235 --> 12:54.605
An excellent idea.

12:54.605 --> 12:57.865
But first, he must entertain us some more.

12:58.035 --> 13:00.305
People are starting to gather, after all.

13:00.705 --> 13:01.735
Flow!

13:14.685 --> 13:20.155
Now, Gee. I want you to fight Flow
and entertain us some more.

13:20.295 --> 13:21.695
I'm so excited.

13:29.135 --> 13:30.275
Is that all?

13:30.275 --> 13:32.205
He can't even fight.

13:32.345 --> 13:34.535
I guess we'll just have to use him as feed.

13:34.645 --> 13:36.135
Hold it!

13:38.045 --> 13:40.035
How can you do such a horrible thing?!

13:40.215 --> 13:43.275
This dragon is a toy that we found.

13:43.785 --> 13:47.445
What we do with it has nothing to do with you.

13:47.485 --> 13:48.625
What?!

13:48.625 --> 13:50.425
You're calling Chibi a toy?!

13:52.065 --> 13:53.195
How rude!

13:53.195 --> 13:54.685
Just who are you?

13:54.925 --> 13:56.085
Please let him go!

13:56.965 --> 13:58.485
Who are you?

14:00.965 --> 14:04.905
Standing before you are the heirs
of the Dalyuus Arcwainwright family...

14:05.205 --> 14:06.835
...Master Lin and Miss Sue.

14:06.905 --> 14:10.145
Dalyuus Ar-Arc...

14:10.145 --> 14:10.905
What's that?

14:11.145 --> 14:13.545
It's that legendary noble family.

14:13.545 --> 14:15.515
I hear they're really rich.

14:15.755 --> 14:18.485
Wow, those two are really important.

14:18.685 --> 14:21.385
And I am their chaperon, Sally.

14:22.025 --> 14:24.115
You may address any concerns to me.

14:24.525 --> 14:26.495
Oh, right. Then, here goes.

14:26.495 --> 14:30.265
That dragon over there is called Chibisuke
and happens to be my partner.

14:30.495 --> 14:32.485
So please, hurry up and let him go.

14:32.865 --> 14:34.855
That's what he says, Master Lin.

14:35.235 --> 14:38.005
Hmm, let's see.

14:39.245 --> 14:40.675
I refuse to return him.

14:40.675 --> 14:44.045
You have no proof
to show that he belongs to you.

14:44.075 --> 14:45.245
Proof?!

14:45.245 --> 14:46.645
There's no way around it.

14:47.485 --> 14:48.675
How much would you like?

14:49.815 --> 14:51.685
We'll purchase that dragon from you.

14:51.925 --> 14:53.185
Would this be enough?

14:53.425 --> 14:54.885
W-Wow!

14:57.325 --> 14:58.515
Satisfied?

14:59.265 --> 15:01.195
You want money too, don't you?

15:14.875 --> 15:17.705
Don't you dare treat Chibi
like he's a toy or a pet.

15:18.475 --> 15:22.005
Chibi is an important friend to me!

15:24.885 --> 15:26.355
Friend?

15:26.355 --> 15:27.755
Are you serious?

15:29.225 --> 15:30.695
What'd you say?!

15:32.365 --> 15:34.385
Chibi!

15:52.715 --> 15:55.115
Hey, you there!

15:55.115 --> 15:56.375
You still want to go at it?!

16:03.855 --> 16:05.455
That is quite incredible!

16:06.465 --> 16:07.955
It's getting very interesting.

16:09.265 --> 16:12.235
Now, we must take this chance
to have more and more of this fun.

16:12.235 --> 16:14.325
Let's all have fun!

16:14.905 --> 16:17.665
Flow, what are you doing?

16:17.835 --> 16:19.805
Why don't you hurry up and attack him?

16:20.045 --> 16:21.665
Attack.

16:22.775 --> 16:23.805
Oh, my. Oh, my.

16:23.975 --> 16:26.275
It seems he's totally lost his will to fight.

16:27.285 --> 16:28.815
How boring.

16:28.815 --> 16:31.255
This isn't interesting at all.

16:31.355 --> 16:33.655
We can't use him after all.

16:33.755 --> 16:35.745
We are quite bored of you now.

16:35.995 --> 16:38.925
We can render him as feed
along with the other one.

16:39.195 --> 16:40.185
What?!

16:40.695 --> 16:41.685
Ekkinsigan!

16:51.405 --> 16:52.565
What is that?!

16:53.075 --> 16:56.665
Ekkinsigan, go ahead
and have those two for your meal!

17:06.725 --> 17:08.085
Chibi!

17:13.865 --> 17:16.195
Whoa!

17:16.195 --> 17:17.355
That's Chibi for you!

17:17.595 --> 17:18.365
It can't be.

17:42.395 --> 17:44.325
- Incredible!
- Who is that guy?!

17:44.325 --> 17:46.085
Is he in the tournament?!

17:46.195 --> 17:47.265
That's right.

17:47.265 --> 17:49.095
I've known him all my life.

17:49.095 --> 17:50.395
Pretty amazing, huh?

18:01.075 --> 18:05.245
That was quite an interesting show,
and an excellent way to kill some time.

18:05.245 --> 18:07.775
Yes, it was a lot of fun.

18:08.015 --> 18:11.475
Now it looks like we'll have something
to entertain us during this tournament.

18:11.615 --> 18:14.145
It's been a while since we were able
to use our full strength in a competition.

18:14.885 --> 18:16.755
Hey! Hang on!

18:16.995 --> 18:18.255
Are you running away?

18:18.255 --> 18:19.245
No.

18:21.865 --> 18:24.425
No, they are not running away at all.

18:24.665 --> 18:27.725
Then what's with the laughter?
Just trying to save face?

18:28.365 --> 18:30.095
Not by any means.

18:30.505 --> 18:33.375
These two really had an interesting time.

18:34.405 --> 18:35.635
Farewell.

18:35.945 --> 18:37.775
Well, we will see you at the tournament.

18:49.655 --> 18:51.385
You sure had a rough time of it.

18:51.825 --> 18:53.555
We'll take that collar off for you.

18:53.665 --> 18:54.655
Chibi!

18:59.035 --> 19:00.635
Now you're free.

19:00.635 --> 19:02.295
You can swim anywhere you want.

19:04.105 --> 19:05.975
You're worried about me?

19:06.205 --> 19:07.445
Don't worry.

19:07.445 --> 19:09.415
You don't have to worry about me.

19:10.775 --> 19:15.075
I won't lose against anyone
who uses a dragon as a tool.

19:16.955 --> 19:19.515
Now, take it easy with the bear hugs!

19:20.855 --> 19:23.325
Hey! Watch it! I'll fall!

19:23.825 --> 19:25.525
Hey! Careful!

19:27.965 --> 19:29.955
That Reiji.

20:22.885 --> 20:24.485
How do you know the pass code?

20:24.485 --> 20:26.115
That's a secret.

20:40.965 --> 20:42.705
So, is this RI-ON's...

20:42.705 --> 20:44.465
Yes, the headquarters.

20:44.735 --> 20:47.405
I know I've asked this before,
but why do you know...

20:48.145 --> 20:53.015
No matter how many times you ask,
the answer is the same: It's a secret.

20:54.485 --> 20:59.385
It really doesn't matter
how I know about RI-ON.

20:59.785 --> 21:02.825
More importantly, are you still sure
that you want to go through with this?

21:02.825 --> 21:03.955
Of course.

21:03.955 --> 21:05.765
Hikaru and the others already went, right?

21:05.765 --> 21:07.955
It'd be frustrating to be abandoned here.

21:08.725 --> 21:10.765
Then just go stand over there.

21:10.765 --> 21:11.595
Okay.

21:12.235 --> 21:13.925
It's all set to go.

21:55.945 --> 21:58.675
taikutsu datta
I was bored

21:58.675 --> 22:01.445
okubyou datta
I was a coward

22:01.445 --> 22:05.405
dareka wo jibun wo kizutsukete ita
I was hurting someone and myself

22:06.855 --> 22:09.625
tsuyogari itte
I tried to hide my weakness

22:09.625 --> 22:11.815
wagamama itte
I was being selfish

22:12.265 --> 22:16.395
doushiyoumonai kimochi mamoritsuzukete
Protecting the uncontrollable feeling

22:17.795 --> 22:20.465
otona ni natte
I became an adult

22:20.465 --> 22:23.205
kimi to deatte
Then I met you

22:23.205 --> 22:27.195
mune no sumikko yawarakaku natte
My heart got softened

22:28.505 --> 22:31.015
setsunaku natta
Longing for love

22:31.015 --> 22:34.015
dakishime atta
We embraced each other

22:34.015 --> 22:38.915
hakkiri mamorubeki mono wo mitsuketa
I finally knew what I wanted to protect

22:39.555 --> 22:42.295
tatta hitotsu no yuuki ga
Only one courage

22:42.295 --> 22:45.055
tatta hitotsu no kotoba ga
Just one word

22:45.055 --> 22:49.725
futari owaranai yume e to hakobu
Take us to an endless dream

22:50.435 --> 22:53.205
hon no chiisana yasashisa ga
Only a small kindness

22:53.205 --> 22:55.875
hon no wazuka na sasayaki ga
Only a small whisper

22:55.875 --> 23:00.535
futari wo sotto tsutsunde kureru
Wrap us gently

23:01.175 --> 23:05.705
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:06.615 --> 23:12.315
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:14.785 --> 23:17.355
Next Episode

23:17.355 --> 23:19.485
The Dragonic Heaven has finally begun!

23:20.695 --> 23:23.225
The first fight is... a preliminary round?

23:23.465 --> 23:25.625
We all have to capture glowing stones?

23:26.265 --> 23:27.755
All right. Let's do it!

23:27.865 --> 23:29.665
Hey! Where's Daisuke?!

23:30.775 --> 23:31.635
Huh?!

23:31.635 --> 23:35.265
Those twins caught him
and they beat him up?!

23:35.815 --> 23:38.745
Next time on Dragon Drive,
"The Anger's End".

23:40.015 --> 23:41.615
What's going on?! Chibi's...

23:41.615 --> 23:41.945
The Anger's End
What's going on?! Chibi's...

23:41.945 --> 23:44.385
The Anger's End
Senkohcoola's body is transforming!
